  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Jemen - UNICEF humanit&#xe4;r appell 2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Jemen - humanit&#xe4;r appel 2011 f&#xf6;r UNICEF. Totalt st&#xf6;d 30 MSEK, varav UNICEF 10 MSEK, UNHCR 10 MSEK, R&#xe4;dda Barnen 5 MSEK och EFF/OCHA 5 MSEK. St&#xf6;det v&#xe4;ntas bidra till att fr&#xe4;mja barn r&#xe4;ttigheter, bl.a. tillg&#xe5;ng till skolg&#xe5;ng och barnv&#xe4;nliga/s&#xe4;kra platser. Genomf&#xf6;rs i samarbete med R&#xe4;dda Barnen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Yemen - Humanitarian Response Plan 2011 for UNICEF. Total support 30 MSEK, of which UNICEF 10 MSEK, UNHCR 10 MSEK, Save the Children 5 MSEK och ERF/OCHA 5 MSEK. The support is expected to contribute to that child rights are met, among others access to school and safe children areas. Implemented in close cooperation with Save the Children.</narrative>
  </description>
